00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:42,000
Bad Boys II is a action, crime, comedy film directed by Michael Bay.

3
00:21:54,000 --> 00:22:00,000
Detectives Marcus Burnett and Mike Lowrey of the Miami Narcotics Task Force are
tasked with stopping the flow of the drug Ecstasy into Miami.

4
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:18,000
They track the drugs to the whacked-out Cuban drug lord Johnny Tapia, who is
also involved in a bloody war with Russian and Haitian mobsters.

5
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:36,000
If that isn't bad enough, there's tension between the two detectives when Marcus
discovers that playboy Mike is secretly romancing Marcus’ sister, Syd.

6
