Theresa, played by Theresa Randle.

12
01:27:36,000 --> 01:27:42,000
Bad Boys II is a 2003 American action comedy film directed by Michael Bay, produced by Jerry Bruckheimer, and
the sequel to the 1995 film Bad Boys, in addition to the second film in the Bad Boys film series.

13
01:34:54,000 --> 01:35:00,000
Martin Lawrence, Will Smith, Theresa Randle, and Joe Pantoliano reprise their roles from the previous film, and
they are joined by new cast members including Jordi Mollà, Gabrielle Union, and Peter Stormare.

14
01:42:12,000 --> 01:42:18,000
The film follows detectives Marcus Burnett and Mike Lowrey
investigating the flow of illegal drugs going into Miami.

15
01:49:30,000 --> 01:49:36,000
The film was released on July 18, 2003, by Sony Pictures
Releasing under the Columbia Pictures label.

16
01:56:48,000 --> 01:56:54,000
It received generally negative reviews from critics; however, it performed well commercially,
grossing $273 million worldwide, becoming the tenth-highest-grossing film of 2003.

17
02:04:06,000 --> 02:04:12,000
Two sequels, Bad Boys for Life and Bad Boys: Ride or Die,
were released in 2020 and 2024, respectively.

18
02:11:24,000 --> 02:11:30,000
The film explores themes of drug smuggling, miami,
florida, undercover agent, cuba, ku klux klan.

